DESCRIPTION                   = "This table contains mineral abundances and
 analytical errors derived from diffraction-all K-alpha diffraction data for
 the Sequoia2 sample, analyzed in pristine CheMin cell number 1b (Kapton
 window). The analysis is based on RDA file
 CMB_751061408RDA39821050418CH00111P1. Mineral identifications, abundances
 and analytical errors for crystalline phases were determined using the
 program JADE. High intensity in the low 2-theta region and a broad
 amorphous hump were modeled using the program FULLPAT to indicate that
 ~43 +/- 25 weight% of the total sample consists of X-ray amorphous
 materials. All errors cited are 2-sigma. Column 1 of the table lists
 mineral identifications, column 2 lists the mineral abundances in weight
 percent, and column 3 indicates the estimated analytical errors."
END_OBJECT                    = SPREADSHEET
